ng the 8 first is the standard "sneak" play to clear low cards. It uses the King to cover the 8 and forces out the opponent\'s high cards (like the remaining 2) while I still have cards to respond. It aims to reduce the hand to a single boss card (2) for a secure finish.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": ["♥8"]}'}
